# Superpowers skills are auto-synced here by the SessionStart hook
# (.claude/hooks/session-start.sh) on every Claude Code on the web session, so
# they always reflect the latest upstream. They are intentionally NOT committed.
#
# To change what's synced, edit the hook — not these files (your edits would be
# overwritten on the next session start).
*
!.gitignore
